    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468750/extras/c3125c19cbf3dbae5c9ed3b7f71c00a6.avif?t=1750767199\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span><strong>Ruins of Blackspire</strong> is a Rogue-like Dungeon Crawler with\u00a0 RTS elements. You go through a handcrafted Dungeon and try to reach the end of each level. To reach the end you need to get stronger by killing enemies or looting chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up</strong> <strong>and use the Skilltree\u00a0</strong>to enhance your classes Abilities or get new Spells to outmaneuver your enemies... or just make them &quot;disappear&quot;. It really is up to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and equip items\u00a0</strong>to increase your stats or give you passive to have an easier time killing all the enemies inside the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of what you are seeing here is obviously WIP (Work in Progress) if you are interested feel free to reach out and let me know what you think!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468750/extras/c3125c19cbf3dbae5c9ed3b7f71c00a6.avif?t=1750767199\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span><strong>Ruins of Blackspire</strong> is a Rogue-like Dungeon Crawler with\u00a0 RTS elements. You go through a handcrafted Dungeon and try to reach the end of each level. To reach the end you need to get stronger by killing enemies or looting chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up</strong> <strong>and use the Skilltree\u00a0</strong>to enhance your classes Abilities or get new Spells to outmaneuver your enemies... or just make them &quot;disappear&quot;. It really is up to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and equip items\u00a0</strong>to increase your stats or give you passive to have an easier time killing all the enemies inside the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of what you are seeing here is obviously WIP (Work in Progress) if you are interested feel free to reach out and let me know what you think!</p>",
